-- Blackrock gear (user ruling 2026-11-14): the Molten dungeon set owns the 64 stock Tier 0.5 entries (Sorcerer's,
-- Virtuous, Feralheart, Five Thunders, Soulforge, Heroism, Beastmaster's and Darkmantle armor, 21994-22113 minus the
-- retired Deathmist 22070-22077), so the Tier 0.5 quest chain stops handing them out: the Molten Normal pieces are
-- earned only through the Blackrock Spire and Blackrock Depths tokens. Quests: An Earnest Proposition, Just
-- Compensation, Anthion's Parting Words and Saving the Best for Last (64 quests, every one a fixed RewardItem reward;
-- no Tier 0.5 quest has a choice reward). The Deathmist quests (8911, 8919, 8936, 8943, 8958, 9005, 9012, 9021) are
-- left as they are (designer question). The quests keep their gold and experience; only the item slots are cleared.
-- quest_template rows are never deleted (codestyle-sql), so each slot is a guarded UPDATE (the reward must still be
-- one of the 64 entries). Re-runnable.
